@gsmet I managed to create a reproducer: [oom-reproducer.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/16487889/oom-reproducer.zip)

`./gradlew test --console=plain --info`

You can add the following argument to get a heap dump:
```
tasks.test {
    jvmArgs("-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError")
}
```
